%%{init: {"themeVariables": {"fontSize": "22px"}, "sequence": {"diagramMarginX": 8, "actorMargin": 10, "width": 72, "messageMargin": 20, "mirrorActors": false}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Producer
    participant S0 as Stage 0
    participant S1 as Stage 1
    participant C as Consumer

    P->>S0: fill tile k @ g
    S0-->>C: full(0,g)
    par overlap
        C->>C: consume tile k from S0
    and
        P->>S1: fill tile k+1 @ g
    end
    C-->>S0: empty(0,g+1)
    P->>S0: fill tile k+2 @ g+1
